{"recordId":"minister_劉太后_1989603539","name":"劉太后","type":"minister","dynasty":"北宋","title":"章獻明肅","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"章献明肃皇后","pageId":513664,"revisionId":94259866,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-09T09:14:57Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%AB%A0%E7%8C%AE%E6%98%8E%E8%82%83%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94259866","wikidataId":"Q5374564","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"权力巅峰的女人","url":"https://books.google.com/books?id=nZB8DwAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%E5%B7%85%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%B3%E4%BA%BA&hl=zh-CN&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwjvz6WAuY_kAhVGGDQIHWLKA2oQ6AEIKDAA#v=onepage&q=%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%E5%B7%85%E5%B3%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%B3%E4%BA%BA&f=false","type":"citation-template","template":"cite book","author":"蒋胜男","publisher":"","date":"2015","isbn":"7510839998","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"中华名女名姬私史","url":"https://books.google.com/books?hl=zh-CN&id=WDAEAQAAIAAJ&dq=%E5%88%98%E5%BB%B6%E5%BA%86+%E5%88%98%E9%80%9A&focus=searchwithinvolume&q=%E5%88%98%E5%BB%B6%E5%BA%86+%E5%88%98%E9%80%9A","type":"citation-template","template":"cite book","author":"郑公、李博","publisher":"內蒙古大学出版社","date":"1998","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:47:03.575Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}},{"title":"刘娥","pageId":611959,"revisionId":86000407,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-02-07T08:33:58Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%88%98%E5%A8%A5","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86000407","wikidataId":"Q10897289","isDisambiguation":true,"disambiguationTargets":["劉娥 (前趙)","章献明肃皇后"],"bibliography":[],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:47:03.575Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:xintangshu","source:songshi","source:mingshi","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:xintangshu-ed8c4ce276be83b7","query":"劉太后","count":1,"offset":1874,"excerpt":"詞誘納。而世充素詭妄，不能仇其語，士大夫遂貳。初，殺文都，欲詭眾取信，乃請事侗母劉太后為假子，至是加號聖感太后。散騎常侍崔德本曰：「此王莽文母何異乎？」後食侗前，得嘔疾，疑見毒，遂不復朝。以將張績、董浚衛宮城。\n\n武德二年，矯侗詔假黃鉞，相國總百","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-751b07472bbce576","query":"劉太后","count":1,"offset":10469,"excerpt":"章事、景靈宮使。\n\n　　三年，祀南郊，進尚書右僕射、集賢殿大學士。時真宗得風疾，劉太后預政於內，準請間曰：「皇太子人所屬望，願陛下思宗廟之重，傳以神器，擇方正大臣為羽翼。丁謂、錢惟演，佞人也，不可以輔少主。」帝然之。準密令翰林學士楊億草表，請太子","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-d407369a7ebda6e7","query":"劉太后","count":3,"offset":130,"excerpt":"　神宗孝端王皇后　劉昭妃　孝靖王太后　鄭貴妃　　光宗孝元郭皇后　孝和王太后　孝純劉太后　李康妃　李莊妃　趙選侍　　熹宗懿安張皇后　張裕妃　　莊烈帝愍周皇后　田貴妃〕\n\n孝康敬皇后\n\n　　孝宗孝康皇后張氏，興濟人。父巒，以鄉貢入太學。母金氏，夢月入","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-327d889c70acafa5","query":"劉太后","count":1,"offset":5603,"excerpt":"宗七子\n\n光宗七子。王太后生熹宗、簡王由㰒。王選侍生齊王由楫。李選侍生懷王由模。劉太后生莊烈皇帝。定懿妃生湘王由栩。敬妃生惠王由橏。\n\n簡懷王由㰒，光宗第二子。生四歲殤。齊思王由楫，光宗第三子。生八歲殤。懷惠王由模，光宗第四子。生五歲殤。湘懷王由","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-1a9221a03caf001d","query":"劉太后","count":1,"offset":2502,"excerpt":"懼而請和，遂築榆陰、安晉二城而還。\n\n成建寧、牂柯二郡來降，李壽復擊取之。\n\n趙劉太后謂彭城王堪曰：「先帝甫晏駕，丞相遽相陵籍如此。帝祚之亡，殆不復久。王將若之何？」堪曰：「先帝舊臣，皆被疏斥，軍旅不復由人，宮省之內，無可為者；臣請奔兗州，挾南陽","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-0cc6dba60e1b525f","query":"劉太后","count":1,"offset":1055,"excerpt":"以瓚為長史。\n\n初，王世充既殺元、盧，慮人情未服，猶媚事皇泰主，禮甚謙敬。又請為劉太后假子，尊號曰聖感皇太后。既而漸驕橫，嘗賜食於禁中，還家大吐，疑遇毒，自是不復朝謁。皇泰主知其終不為臣，而力不能制，唯取內庫彩物大造幡花；又出諸服玩，令僧散施貧乏","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":6,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:xintangshu-ed8c4ce276be83b7","bookId":"book:xintangshu","requestedTitle":"新唐書/卷085","title":"新唐書/卷085","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E5%94%90%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7085","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=7905176","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E5%94%90%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7085?action=history","revisionId":7905176,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-06-29T02:02:05Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:53:04.166Z","sha256":"6320c0f2be02d2b98a279efb74ea7b81ae1db29febbabfd8c1c0b8a5d6b7b870","textSha256":"89a5066300189fdf2c655cbb5fdc92dbd07ad7322317f0802fa768bbd43024ae","expandedWikitextSha256":"6320c0f2be02d2b98a279efb74ea7b81ae1db29febbabfd8c1c0b8a5d6b7b870","characters":7718,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/xintangshu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:39.938Z","upstreamTextQuality":25,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 25% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/da7814637b37d7d69171.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/da7814637b37d7d69171.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:songshi-751b07472bbce576","bookId":"book:songshi","requestedTitle":"宋史/卷281","title":"宋史/卷281","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7281","revisionUrl":"